ᬲᭀᬭᭀᬄ Sato:
    ᬕᬯᬾ __init__(self, adan):
        self.adan = adan

    ᬕᬯᬾ suara(self):
        ᬩᬮᬶᬬᬂ "..."

ᬲᭀᬭᭀᬄ Cicing(Sato):
    ᬕᬯᬾ suara(self):
        ᬩᬮᬶᬬᬂ "Kong kong"

ᬲᭀᬭᭀᬄ Meong(Sato):
    ᬕᬯᬾ suara(self):
        ᬩᬮᬶᬬᬂ "Ngeong"

ᬉᬮᬂ s ᬭᬶᬂ [Cicing("Bruno"), Meong("Mimi")]:
    ᬢᬸᬮᬶᬲ᭄(s.adan, "nyatur", s.suara())
